    "title": "Basketball Recap: Hustisford Comes Up Short - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Team Reports ,\n1 days ago Hustisford was not able to break out of their rough patch on Monday as the team picked up their eighth straight loss dating back to last season. They were outmatched by the Elkhart Lake-Glenbeulah Resorters and fell 77-30. While losing is never fun, the Falcons can't take it too hard given the team's big disadvantage in MaxPreps' Wisconsin basketball rankings (they are ranked 349th, while the Resorters are ranked 75th). Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
